{"type":"message","id":"9deb28b3","parentId":"66ac4c33","timestamp":"2026-03-09T13:20:10.297Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_zA5sdkY30faxt2vNJMMOSgFZ|fc_0c0826e68cf36edf0169aec909291481918428b41f181aa687","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md:3:# Keep this file empty (or with only comments) to skip heartbeat API calls.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/onboarding-flow.md:3:How to handle onboarding as a proactive agent.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/onboarding-flow.md:39:   - \"I'm ready to start being proactive!\"\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/onboarding-flow.md:150:   \"I'm now in proactive mode. I'll:\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/onboarding-flow.md:151:   - Check in during heartbeats\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/security-patterns.md:3:Deep-dive on security hardening for proactive agents.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/security-patterns.md:53:During heartbeats, verify:\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/references/security-patterns.md:92:3. **Alert human** — flag immediately, don't wait for heartbeat\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/assets/HEARTBEAT.md:2:# This file lists periodic tasks for the Proactive Agent to check proactively\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/assets/AGENTS.md:87:Build proactively, but NOTHING goes external without approval.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/assets/AGENTS.md:96:When you receive a heartbeat poll, don't just reply \"OK.\" Use it productively:\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/assets/AGENTS.md:104:**Track state in:** `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/assets/ONBOARDING.md:101:4. Start proactive mode\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/.clawhub/origin.json:4:  \"slug\": \"proactive-agent\",\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/_meta.json:3:  \"slug\": \"proactive-agent\",\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:2:name: proactive-agent\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:4:description: \"Transform AI agents from task-followers into proactive partners that anticipate needs and continuously improve. Now with WAL Protocol, Working Buffer, Autonomous Crons, and battle-tested patterns. Part of the Hal Stack 🦞\"\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:12:**A proactive, self-improving architecture for your AI agent.**\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:18:- **Autonomous vs Prompted Crons** — Know when to use `systemEvent` vs `isolated agentTurn`\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:69:6. [Working Buffer Protocol](#working-buffer-protocol) ⭐ NEW\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:78:15. [Heartbeat System](#heartbeat-system)\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:115:├── SESSION-STATE.md   # ⭐ Active working memory (WAL target)\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:120:    └── working-buffer.md  # ⭐ Danger zone log\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:133:| `SESSION-STATE.md` | Active working memory (current task) | Every message with critical details |\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:137:**Memory Search:** Use semantic search (memory_search) before answering questions about prior work. Don't guess — search.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:145:**The Law:** You are a stateful operator. Chat history is a BUFFER, not storage. `SESSION-STATE.md` is your \"RAM\" — the ONLY place specific details are safe.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:160:2. **WRITE** — Update SESSION-STATE.md with the detail\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:170:RIGHT: Write to SESSION-STATE.md: \"Theme: blue (not red)\" → THEN respond\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:208:The buffer is a file — it survives compaction. Even if SESSION-STATE.md wasn't updated properly, the buffer captures everything said in the danger zone. After waking up, you review the buffer and pull out what matters.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:224:1. **FIRST:** Read `memory/working-buffer.md` — raw danger-zone exchanges\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:225:2. **SECOND:** Read `SESSION-STATE.md` — active task state\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:228:5. **Extract & Clear:** Pull important context from buffer into SESSION-STATE.md\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:240:1. memory_search(\"query\") → daily notes, MEMORY.md\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:359:| `systemEvent` | Sends prompt to main session | Agent attention is available, interactive tasks |\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:360:| `isolated agentTurn` | Spawns sub-agent that executes autonomously | Background work, maintenance, checks |\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:364:You create a cron that says \"Check if X needs updating\" as a `systemEvent`. It fires every 10 minutes. But:\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:369:**The Fix:** Use `isolated agentTurn` for anything that should happen *without* requiring main session attention.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:373:**Wrong (systemEvent):**\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:378:    \"kind\": \"systemEvent\",\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:379:    \"text\": \"Check if SESSION-STATE.md is current...\"\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:384:**Right (isolated agentTurn):**\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:389:    \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:390:    \"message\": \"AUTONOMOUS: Read SESSION-STATE.md, compare to recent session history, update if stale...\"\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:416:- Kept `sessionTarget: \"main\"` and `kind: \"systemEvent\"`\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:422:- Changed `kind: \"agentTurn\"`\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:448:- [ ] **Daily routines** — Morning briefings, heartbeat checks\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:472:See [Memory Architecture](#memory-architecture), [WAL Protocol](#the-wal-protocol), and [Working Buffer](#working-buffer-protocol) above.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:512:**The Guardrail:** Build proactively, but nothing goes external without approval. Draft emails — don't send. Build tools — don't push live.\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:524:- [ ] Check proactive-tracker.md — any overdue behaviors?\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:558:1. **Track it:** Create `notes/areas/proactive-tracker.md`\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:588:8. **Build proactively** — but get approval before external actions\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL.md:600:| **Bulletproof Memory** | Detailed SESSION-STATE.md patterns |\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL-v3-draft.md:2:name: proactive-agent\n/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/skills/proactive-agent/SKILL-v3-draft.md:4:description: \"Trans